    - target: {fileID: 8202928473594746054, guid: d4b1b937ea86eec4390515a46ba044fe, type: 3}
      propertyPath: description
      value: "\u2022 Navigate through the <b>network</b> by moving from one <i>node</i>
        to another.  \r\n\u2022 Hack eligible <b>devices</b> connected to the nodes
        you control.  \r\n\u2022 Avoid <color=red>red zones</color>, as they represent
        dangerous or secured areas.  \r\n\u2022 You must hack the required number
        of <b>devices</b> before <b>time runs out</b>.  \r\n\u2022 Plan your route
        carefully \u2014 getting trapped or detected may cost you valuable time. 
        \r\n\u2022 Reach the hacking quota to <b>complete the challenge</b>.  "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
